  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section class="check-understanding"><exercise data-content-id="aa770c91-6152-463d-9f99-edbe3fb79379"><problem><para>
      <para>Solve each equation and write the solutions using the ± notation, then choose the correct solution from the list.</para>
      <para>\(x^2=144\)</para>
      </para><para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(x= \pm\; 144\)</para><para>\(x= \pm\; 72\)</para><para>\(x= \pm\; 12\)</para><para>\(x= \pm\; 24\)</para></problem><solution><para>\(x= \pm\; 12\)</para><para>
      <para>The correct answer is: \(x= \pm\; 12\).
      </para>
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
